  "duration_s": 383.137931,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集说到一九四九年，身在伦敦的李四光站在人生最大的悬崖边上，国民党当局放话不公开声明，不回国，就把你扣在海外留下来洋房搞废国际地位。要啥有啥回去，一个刚打完仗，百废待兴的新中国，你猜他怎么选？他放下半生心血，悄悄离开伦敦，斩开，辗转多地冲破封锁。一九五零年，终于踏上祖国的故土。这一回去，他干了一件让全世界瞠目结舌的事，把扣在中国头上几十年的平游国帽子亲手撕了个粉碎。啥叫平游国？说出来，你可能不信。二十世纪上半叶，国际地质界流行一句话，中国平游一九二二年美国斯坦福大学。一位教授公开断言，中国东北不会有大量食言，此前美孚石油公司，跑到中国西北打了足足七口，井一滴油都没见着，于是西方给中国扣上了一顶帽子。平游国，这顶帽子有多重？你琢磨琢磨，一个没有石油的国家，飞机上不了天，坦克跑不动，路工业的血库是干的。谈什么强国，从一九二八年起，李四光就公开发声，跟平游论叫板。一九三五年，他在英国多所大学演讲明确指出，新华夏构造体系的内陆沉降带蕴藏着巨大的找由原景。啥是新华夏构造体系？说人话，地球在应力作用下，在中国东部挤出了一连串北北东走向的盆地带，像一条条被压出来的长槽，李四光把这些沉降带分成三个，等于在地图上给新中国的石油勘探画出了三道金线。一九五二年，李四光出任新中国首任地质部部长。一九五三年底，毛泽东主席周南总理在中南海专门把他请了去，当面问了一句话，中国的地下到底能不能找到石油？当时国内外多少权威，早就把话说死了。中国没有大油田，顶着全世界的质疑。李四光摊开自己手绘的中国地质草图，斩钉截铁，倾华夏构造体系的三大沉降带，既生油又出油。中国绝不会平油。一九五四年，全国石油地质普查委员会成立李四光亲任主任。一场史无前例的石油大会战在九百六十万平方公里的土地上铺开了。那时候的勘探队员，背着仪弃走进茫茫荒原，风餐露宿，没人知道能不能找到。可没人退缩，可很少有人知道，这场大会战的总指挥自己正在拼着命找牛。一九五七年，长期透支的李四光，因为节石切除了左肾，只剩一个肾，医生反复叮嘱静养，必须敬仰。可他的心从来没有离开过勘探前线。有人劝他一把年纪了，野外吃苦的事儿交给年轻人吧。李四光摇摇头说了一句让人鼻子发酸的话，地质工作就是要跑野外，坐在办公室里是找不到石油的荒山野岭，风餐露宿，一个只剩一个肾的老人，嗯，带着队伍翻遍山河历史，给了这位老人最响亮的回音。一九五九年九月二十六日，松积三井在松辽盆地喷出工业油流，大庆油田横空出世。从一九五五年全国普查启动到大庆突破，只用了大约四年四年。一个被全世界断言无有可救的平庸国打出了自己的大油田。大庆之后，华北大港胜利，辽河、江汉、南阳油田一个接一个被发现，东北、华北乃至两湖的地下喜讯不断。一九六三年，周恩来总理在二届人大四次会议上庄严宣告。我国需要的石油现在可以基本自己听到这句话，李四光这个大半生被西方冷眼相待的科学家热泪盈眶。当年哪顶扣在中国头上的贫油帽子，被他自己亲手摘了下来。很多人以为李四光这一生的功劳到此就结束，石油有了功业的血库满了这位老人总该先这一些了吧？可很少有人知道，就在石油难题即将攻克的同时，还有一道更凶险的国防难关。横在他面前，造原子弹必不可少的油矿遭到全世界封锁，没有油，两弹就是一句空话。这道关他怎么闯他生命的最后几年又拼到了什么程度？咱们下级大结局，关注我下集，带你看一个八十二岁的老人。如何把最后的光烧成两代人的信仰、点赞、收藏、转发，让更多人知道。今天我们开车加满油，背后有这样一个拼着命找由的人。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 2490,
      "text": "上集说到一九四九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2550,
      "end_ms": 7290,
      "text": "身在伦敦的李四光站在人生最大的悬崖边上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00003",
      "start_ms": 7790,
      "end_ms": 10770,
      "text": "国民党当局放话不公开声明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00004",
      "start_ms": 10770,
      "end_ms": 11410,
      "text": "不回国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00005",
      "start_ms": 11690,
      "end_ms": 17270,
      "text": "就把你扣在海外留下来洋房搞废国际地位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00006",
      "start_ms": 17470,
      "end_ms": 20030,
      "text": "要啥有啥回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00007",
      "start_ms": 20330,
      "end_ms": 21710,
      "text": "一个刚打完仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00008",
      "start_ms": 22010,
      "end_ms": 23790,
      "text": "百废待兴的新中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00009",
      "start_ms": 24010,
      "end_ms": 25110,
      "text": "你猜他怎么选？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00010",
      "start_ms": 25930,
      "end_ms": 27630,
      "text": "他放下半生心血，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00011",
      "start_ms": 27950,
      "end_ms": 29310,
      "text": "悄悄离开伦敦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00012",
      "start_ms": 29730,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "斩开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00013",
      "start_ms": 30060,
      "end_ms": 32500,
      "text": "辗转多地冲破封锁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00014",
      "start_ms": 32980,
      "end_ms": 34000,
      "text": "一九五零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00015",
      "start_ms": 34260,
      "end_ms": 36580,
      "text": "终于踏上祖国的故土。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00016",
      "start_ms": 36740,
      "end_ms": 37540,
      "text": "这一回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00017",
      "start_ms": 37740,
      "end_ms": 41420,
      "text": "他干了一件让全世界瞠目结舌的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41880,
      "end_ms": 48000,
      "text": "把扣在中国头上几十年的平游国帽子亲手撕了个粉碎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00019",
      "start_ms": 48560,
      "end_ms": 49680,
      "text": "啥叫平游国？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00020",
      "start_ms": 50060,
      "end_ms": 50520,
      "text": "说出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00021",
      "start_ms": 50520,
      "end_ms": 51300,
      "text": "你可能不信。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00022",
      "start_ms": 51840,
      "end_ms": 53320,
      "text": "二十世纪上半叶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00023",
      "start_ms": 53620,
      "end_ms": 55540,
      "text": "国际地质界流行一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00024",
      "start_ms": 56040,
      "end_ms": 60350,
      "text": "中国平游一九二二年美国斯坦福大学。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00025",
      "start_ms": 60490,
      "end_ms": 62325,
      "text": "一位教授公开断言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00026",
      "start_ms": 62780,
      "end_ms": 65685,
      "text": "中国东北不会有大量食言，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00027",
      "start_ms": 66220,
      "end_ms": 68100,
      "text": "此前美孚石油公司，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00028",
      "start_ms": 68100,
      "end_ms": 70670,
      "text": "跑到中国西北打了足足七口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00029",
      "start_ms": 70670,
      "end_ms": 72365,
      "text": "井一滴油都没见着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00030",
      "start_ms": 73240,
      "end_ms": 76435,
      "text": "于是西方给中国扣上了一顶帽子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00031",
      "start_ms": 77500,
      "end_ms": 78465,
      "text": "平游国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00032",
      "start_ms": 79210,
      "end_ms": 80575,
      "text": "这顶帽子有多重？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00033",
      "start_ms": 81530,
      "end_ms": 82345,
      "text": "你琢磨琢磨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00034",
      "start_ms": 83350,
      "end_ms": 85105,
      "text": "一个没有石油的国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00035",
      "start_ms": 85340,
      "end_ms": 86455,
      "text": "飞机上不了天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00036",
      "start_ms": 87000,
      "end_ms": 88000,
      "text": "坦克跑不动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00037",
      "start_ms": 88000,
      "end_ms": 90055,
      "text": "路工业的血库是干的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00038",
      "start_ms": 90440,
      "end_ms": 91415,
      "text": "谈什么强国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00039",
      "start_ms": 92160,
      "end_ms": 93565,
      "text": "从一九二八年起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00040",
      "start_ms": 93950,
      "end_ms": 95755,
      "text": "李四光就公开发声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00041",
      "start_ms": 96140,
      "end_ms": 97585,
      "text": "跟平游论叫板。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00042",
      "start_ms": 98280,
      "end_ms": 99255,
      "text": "一九三五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00043",
      "start_ms": 99590,
      "end_ms": 103155,
      "text": "他在英国多所大学演讲明确指出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00044",
      "start_ms": 103660,
      "end_ms": 110295,
      "text": "新华夏构造体系的内陆沉降带蕴藏着巨大的找由原景。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00045",
      "start_ms": 111020,
      "end_ms": 112805,
      "text": "啥是新华夏构造体系？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00046",
      "start_ms": 113440,
      "end_ms": 114225,
      "text": "说人话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00047",
      "start_ms": 114700,
      "end_ms": 116445,
      "text": "地球在应力作用下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00048",
      "start_ms": 116800,
      "end_ms": 121950,
      "text": "在中国东部挤出了一连串北北东走向的盆地带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00049",
      "start_ms": 122490,
      "end_ms": 125250,
      "text": "像一条条被压出来的长槽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00050",
      "start_ms": 125970,
      "end_ms": 129250,
      "text": "李四光把这些沉降带分成三个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00051",
      "start_ms": 130090,
      "end_ms": 136250,
      "text": "等于在地图上给新中国的石油勘探画出了三道金线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00052",
      "start_ms": 137970,
      "end_ms": 138950,
      "text": "一九五二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00053",
      "start_ms": 139310,
      "end_ms": 142850,
      "text": "李四光出任新中国首任地质部部长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00054",
      "start_ms": 143550,
      "end_ms": 144750,
      "text": "一九五三年底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00055",
      "start_ms": 144990,
      "end_ms": 149665,
      "text": "毛泽东主席周南总理在中南海专门把他请了去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00056",
      "start_ms": 150070,
      "end_ms": 151190,
      "text": "当面问了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00057",
      "start_ms": 152090,
      "end_ms": 155930,
      "text": "中国的地下到底能不能找到石油？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00058",
      "start_ms": 156790,
      "end_ms": 158550,
      "text": "当时国内外多少权威，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00059",
      "start_ms": 158790,
      "end_ms": 160350,
      "text": "早就把话说死了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00060",
      "start_ms": 160730,
      "end_ms": 162330,
      "text": "中国没有大油田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00061",
      "start_ms": 162690,
      "end_ms": 164370,
      "text": "顶着全世界的质疑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00062",
      "start_ms": 164790,
      "end_ms": 168370,
      "text": "李四光摊开自己手绘的中国地质草图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00063",
      "start_ms": 168850,
      "end_ms": 169990,
      "text": "斩钉截铁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00064",
      "start_ms": 170390,
      "end_ms": 173330,
      "text": "倾华夏构造体系的三大沉降带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00065",
      "start_ms": 173850,
      "end_ms": 175310,
      "text": "既生油又出油。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00066",
      "start_ms": 175670,
      "end_ms": 177710,
      "text": "中国绝不会平油。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00067",
      "start_ms": 178370,
      "end_ms": 179505,
      "text": "一九五四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00068",
      "start_ms": 179860,
      "end_ms": 183865,
      "text": "全国石油地质普查委员会成立李四光亲任主任。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00069",
      "start_ms": 184580,
      "end_ms": 191015,
      "text": "一场史无前例的石油大会战在九百六十万平方公里的土地上铺开了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00070",
      "start_ms": 192010,
      "end_ms": 193495,
      "text": "那时候的勘探队员，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00071",
      "start_ms": 194000,
      "end_ms": 196545,
      "text": "背着仪弃走进茫茫荒原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00072",
      "start_ms": 197050,
      "end_ms": 198155,
      "text": "风餐露宿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00073",
      "start_ms": 198530,
      "end_ms": 200045,
      "text": "没人知道能不能找到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00074",
      "start_ms": 200300,
      "end_ms": 201195,
      "text": "可没人退缩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00075",
      "start_ms": 201700,
      "end_ms": 203045,
      "text": "可很少有人知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00076",
      "start_ms": 203320,
      "end_ms": 206835,
      "text": "这场大会战的总指挥自己正在拼着命找牛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00077",
      "start_ms": 209520,
      "end_ms": 210475,
      "text": "一九五七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00078",
      "start_ms": 210920,
      "end_ms": 212875,
      "text": "长期透支的李四光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00079",
      "start_ms": 213340,
      "end_ms": 215735,
      "text": "因为节石切除了左肾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00080",
      "start_ms": 216340,
      "end_ms": 217305,
      "text": "只剩一个肾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00081",
      "start_ms": 217950,
      "end_ms": 219875,
      "text": "医生反复叮嘱静养，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00082",
      "start_ms": 221470,
      "end_ms": 222355,
      "text": "必须敬仰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00083",
      "start_ms": 223250,
      "end_ms": 227275,
      "text": "可他的心从来没有离开过勘探前线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00084",
      "start_ms": 228250,
      "end_ms": 231495,
      "text": "有人劝他一把年纪了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00085",
      "start_ms": 231860,
      "end_ms": 235875,
      "text": "野外吃苦的事儿交给年轻人吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00086",
      "start_ms": 237340,
      "end_ms": 241775,
      "text": "李四光摇摇头说了一句让人鼻子发酸的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00087",
      "start_ms": 242550,
      "end_ms": 244865,
      "text": "地质工作就是要跑野外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00088",
      "start_ms": 245800,
      "end_ms": 250345,
      "text": "坐在办公室里是找不到石油的荒山野岭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00089",
      "start_ms": 250650,
      "end_ms": 251595,
      "text": "风餐露宿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00090",
      "start_ms": 252570,
      "end_ms": 254565,
      "text": "一个只剩一个肾的老人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00091",
      "start_ms": 254690,
      "end_ms": 254825,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00092",
      "start_ms": 255420,
      "end_ms": 258995,
      "text": "带着队伍翻遍山河历史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00093",
      "start_ms": 259230,
      "end_ms": 261905,
      "text": "给了这位老人最响亮的回音。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00094",
      "start_ms": 262170,
      "end_ms": 264245,
      "text": "一九五九年九月二十六日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00095",
      "start_ms": 264680,
      "end_ms": 268985,
      "text": "松积三井在松辽盆地喷出工业油流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00096",
      "start_ms": 269460,
      "end_ms": 271875,
      "text": "大庆油田横空出世。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00097",
      "start_ms": 272310,
      "end_ms": 276225,
      "text": "从一九五五年全国普查启动到大庆突破，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00098",
      "start_ms": 276810,
      "end_ms": 279260,
      "text": "只用了大约四年四年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00099",
      "start_ms": 279300,
      "end_ms": 284985,
      "text": "一个被全世界断言无有可救的平庸国打出了自己的大油田。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00100",
      "start_ms": 285570,
      "end_ms": 286365,
      "text": "大庆之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00101",
      "start_ms": 286710,
      "end_ms": 288715,
      "text": "华北大港胜利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00102",
      "start_ms": 289050,
      "end_ms": 293565,
      "text": "辽河、江汉、南阳油田一个接一个被发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00103",
      "start_ms": 294140,
      "end_ms": 297705,
      "text": "东北、华北乃至两湖的地下喜讯不断。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00104",
      "start_ms": 298230,
      "end_ms": 299150,
      "text": "一九六三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00105",
      "start_ms": 299150,
      "end_ms": 303375,
      "text": "周恩来总理在二届人大四次会议上庄严宣告。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00106",
      "start_ms": 303910,
      "end_ms": 309070,
      "text": "我国需要的石油现在可以基本自己听到这句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00107",
      "start_ms": 309530,
      "end_ms": 315410,
      "text": "李四光这个大半生被西方冷眼相待的科学家热泪盈眶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00108",
      "start_ms": 316270,
      "end_ms": 320150,
      "text": "当年哪顶扣在中国头上的贫油帽子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00109",
      "start_ms": 320450,
      "end_ms": 324030,
      "text": "被他自己亲手摘了下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00110",
      "start_ms": 324510,
      "end_ms": 328590,
      "text": "很多人以为李四光这一生的功劳到此就结束，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00111",
      "start_ms": 329150,
      "end_ms": 335380,
      "text": "石油有了功业的血库满了这位老人总该先这一些了吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00112",
      "start_ms": 335380,
      "end_ms": 336640,
      "text": "可很少有人知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00113",
      "start_ms": 337400,
      "end_ms": 340580,
      "text": "就在石油难题即将攻克的同时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00114",
      "start_ms": 341080,
      "end_ms": 344040,
      "text": "还有一道更凶险的国防难关。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00115",
      "start_ms": 344400,
      "end_ms": 345480,
      "text": "横在他面前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00116",
      "start_ms": 345900,
      "end_ms": 351340,
      "text": "造原子弹必不可少的油矿遭到全世界封锁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00117",
      "start_ms": 351620,
      "end_ms": 352240,
      "text": "没有油，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00118",
      "start_ms": 352720,
      "end_ms": 354340,
      "text": "两弹就是一句空话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00119",
      "start_ms": 354820,
      "end_ms": 361040,
      "text": "这道关他怎么闯他生命的最后几年又拼到了什么程度？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00120",
      "start_ms": 361620,
      "end_ms": 363435,
      "text": "咱们下级大结局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00121",
      "start_ms": 364490,
      "end_ms": 365990,
      "text": "关注我下集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00122",
      "start_ms": 365990,
      "end_ms": 368420,
      "text": "带你看一个八十二岁的老人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00123",
      "start_ms": 368540,
      "end_ms": 374900,
      "text": "如何把最后的光烧成两代人的信仰、点赞、收藏、转发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00124",
      "start_ms": 375180,
      "end_ms": 376595,
      "text": "让更多人知道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00125",
      "start_ms": 377490,
      "end_ms": 379455,
      "text": "今天我们开车加满油，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_276035124ad947a4_s00126",
      "start_ms": 380050,
      "end_ms": 383090,
      "text": "背后有这样一个拼着命找由的人。"
    }
  ],
